sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Script or CLI
    participant Diag as Diagram Context
    participant Group as Group Context
    participant Pipe as run_layout (pipeline.py)
    participant Side as sidecar.py
    participant Layered as LayeredLayout
    participant Solver as ConstraintSolver
    participant Router as OrthogonalRouter
    participant SVG as SVGRenderer
    participant Out as output.render_all
    participant Raster as rasterize.py
    participant BOM as BOMGenerator

    User->>Diag: with Diagram("Arch", theme="nord", layout="auto") as diag
    activate Diag
    Diag->>Diag: Push context onto context.py's active stack

    User->>Group: with diag.group("Zone") as g
    activate Group
    User->>Diag: Shape("node1", "Client", icon="mobile")
    User->>Diag: Shape("node2", "Server", icon="server")
    Note over Group: unpinned children left unplaced under layout="auto"
    deactivate Group

    User->>Diag: node1 >> diag.edge("HTTPS") >> node2
    User->>Diag: Exit with context block
    deactivate Diag

    User->>Diag: diag.render_svg("out.svg")
    activate Diag
    Diag->>Diag: Check _is_solved dirty flag
    Diag->>Pipe: diag.solve() delegates to run_layout(diag)
    activate Pipe
    Pipe->>Side: apply layout-file overrides (leading absolute constraints)
    Side-->>Pipe: matched entries applied, stale keys warn
    Pipe->>Layered: arrange each scope's unpinned nodes, deepest-first
    Layered-->>Pipe: {node_id: Point}, tagged source="auto"
    Pipe->>Solver: solve() the full constraint DAG
    Solver-->>Pipe: relative constraints resolved
    Pipe->>Pipe: Recalculate group bounds bottom-up
    Pipe->>Pipe: Auto-frame negative coordinates to (60, 80)
    Pipe->>Pipe: Grow canvas to fit content past width/height
    Pipe->>Pipe: warn LayoutWarning on pinned/auto-placed overlap
    Pipe->>Router: route every edge (OrthogonalRouter / CurveRouter)
    activate Router
    Router->>Router: Select cardinal ports & port normal tangents
    Router->>Router: Compute waypoints / Bezier handles & deflect obstacles
    Router-->>Pipe: routes keyed by edge
    deactivate Router
    Pipe-->>Diag: Layout + routes ready
    deactivate Pipe

    Diag->>SVG: render(elements, groups, edges, routes)
    activate SVG
    SVG->>SVG: Inject theme palette & SVG defs
    SVG->>SVG: Emit paths (filleted Q or curved C)
    SVG->>SVG: Multi-line wrap labels (<tspan>)
    SVG->>SVG: Embed interactive HUD (pan/zoom/search/minimap)
    SVG-->>Diag: Complete XML SVG string
    deactivate SVG
    Diag->>User: Write out.svg

    User->>Out: render_all(diag, out_dir, stem, formats)
    activate Out
    Out->>Diag: render_png("out.png")
    Diag->>Raster: svg_to_png_bytes(svg_string)
    Note over Raster: resvg-py -> CairoSVG -> Inkscape -> ImageMagick, first available wins
    Raster-->>Diag: PNG byte buffer
    Out->>BOM: generate_markdown(svg_path) / generate_bom_json(...)
    BOM-->>Out: Markdown tables + JSON schema
    Out-->>User: Write out.png, out_README.md, out_bom.json
    deactivate Out
